cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Proof-Carrying Science, cite the exact source revision or tagged
  public release so readers can reproduce the Lean proof and verifier build.
title: Proof-Carrying Science
type: software
authors:
  - name: Proof-Carrying Science contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/Tommaso-R-Marena/proof-carrying-science
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Open reference specifications, executable verification, and formal Lean
  proofs for bounded, independently checkable scientific assurance claims.
  Passing a formal check does not establish general scientific truth.
keywords:
  - formal verification
  - Lean 4
  - reproducible science
  - scientific assurance
